            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Connie Burnett"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is bar none my favorite cranberry relish! I made the day before the event. Instead of Grand Marnier, I used about a teaspoon or so of orange extract, and then substituted Bourbon for the Grand Marnier. It is absolutely heavenly.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-25T16:44:06.937Z"
          },
