            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Scott M"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted 1/4 teaspoon of ground ginger for the fresh root and it was just enough for a little hint of ginger. I also used Triple Sec in lieu of the Grand Marnier, omitted pecans (allergies) and increased the orange zest to 2-3 Tbsp.; its about what a small orange produced.\nDelicious, everyone enjoyed it, I will be making this again, thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-23T13:45:03.347Z"
          },
